Package: devjam-science-experiment-mode-rtirq
Version: 1.45-2
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: rtirq
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Experiment mode with real-time IRQ priorities for lab timing
 Experiment mode for lab computers with deterministic timing for EEG,
 button boxes and audio-visual stimuli. It adds GRUB entries that
 isolate CPU cores, rtirq profiles for normal and experiment mode, a
 service that pins audio IRQs (internal and USB) to the isolated cores,
 and tools to switch and verify the setup (switch-rtirq, verify-rtirq,
 check-isolation, check-rt-processes, usb-affinity).
